## Not yet checked in the game {% #live-check %}

The build requests come from another bot's code, based on its captures of the game client. Run the plan with **Log only** first. Then check one cheap upgrade on a spare account before you rely on it. The same holds for a wood and stone transfer to the Storm Islands: send one small transfer with **Build supply** before you rely on it.
